Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Obtain qualified review of the exact variant, publish controlled copies, and coordinate acknowledgment or training. Retire outdated copies without erasing historical execution records and re-evaluate affected instructions when equipment or master procedures change.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
